  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14227844/assets/dc692d5337c00f1cca52fe3020d26a2859288c257f0a049e3f6b7f159353d7ce.png)\n\nLet $T=\\{0,1,3,4\\}.$ The graph above shows the value of $g(t)$ for each $t\\in T.$ Assuming that all the dots have integer coordinates, compute the following:\n\n${max}_{t\\in T}g(t)=$\n{{field-1}}\n\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{t\\in T}g(t)=$\n{{field-2}}\n\n${min}_{t\\in T}g(t)=$\n{{field-3}}\n\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{t\\in T}g(t)=$\n{{field-4}}",
